&lt;p&gt;    Thanks @lresende for contribution.&lt;br/&gt;
    I have tested this patch, but i still get the same error.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    How to test&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    1) build `gh-pages` (website) branch&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    ```&lt;br/&gt;
    bundle exec jekyll build --safe&lt;br/&gt;
    mv _site /tmp/zeppelin_website&lt;br/&gt;
    ```&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    2) build this patch (docs) and copy it under docs/0.7.0-SNAPSHOT of website&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    ```&lt;br/&gt;
    cd docs&lt;br/&gt;
    bundle exec jekyll build --safe&lt;br/&gt;
    mkdir /tmp/zeppelin-website/docs&lt;br/&gt;
    mv _site /tmp/zeppelin_website/0.7.0-SNAPSHOT&lt;br/&gt;
    ```&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    3) start httpserver &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    ```&lt;br/&gt;
    cd /tmp/zeppelin_website&lt;br/&gt;
    python -m SimpleHTTPServer&lt;br/&gt;
    ```&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    And browse localhost:8000, select 0.7.0-SNAPSHOT doc and try search&lt;/p&gt;
</comment>
